ent i.e.,  Pharmaceuticals .       7. The Financial Results are available on the company's website www.ajantapharma.com, www.nseindia.com and www.bseindia.com.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
